<title>MEXICO: Bufete Industrial outlines year-end backlog.</title>
<headline>Bufete Industrial outlines year-end backlog.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction and engineering company, Bufete Industrial, said on Monday that its year-end 1996 backlog was 3.263 billion pesos.</p>
